msgstr "训练流水线、特征存储、模型注册表"

#: ../../source/chapters/03-what-is-harness-engineering.md:131
#: 71e56dfa040f4ab4b597403f50ad9e0a
msgid "Hidden technical debt in feedback loops and data drift"
msgstr "反馈回路和数据漂移里隐藏着的技术债"

#: ../../source/chapters/03-what-is-harness-engineering.md:132
#: e2b8cea7c4d1410c9530b44eae67cc1b
msgid ""
"Shares versioning discipline; model-evaluation harnesses feed *signals* into"
" an agent harness but sit upstream of it"
msgstr "共享\"版本化\"这一纪律；模型评估 harness 把 *信号* 喂给智能体挽具，但它位于挽具的上游"

#: ../../source/chapters/03-what-is-harness-engineering.md:134
